{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S13把“谁也没法答应永远”改成“就算听到了”，削弱了他明知无法保证却仍渴望保证的心理因果，这一处Y表达更准确。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮短语能让观众迅速抓住每段的心理转折，不必先读完整句话；感受又能随音乐出现，减少一次性堆在屏幕上的信息，并提供更具体的音乐和身体感受。反复出现的水、船、漂浮、靠岸等意象，也让情绪变化有了贯穿全曲的线索。不过Y的叙述在解释人物动机和因果关系时更完整、更自然，X有少数地方为了拆分和突出信息而损失了原本的心理逻辑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6009d980-ae6f-491c-a91c-b69db6b5f801", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001150509121Z", "elapsed_seconds": 94.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:13:24.881747+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ec3ceb2dbdb853fb5eeb5fc0f881396beacd3ac82fc9ef27416974172fb1c8f9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen